I generally have a lot of trouble keeping ponies/horses/warhorses alive
because of the nutrition problem.  However, they are quite strong and
fast so are probably worth it just for fun and to give it a try.

I doubt that you'll see too many lichens given your level but I try to
save lichen corpses just in case I meet a vegetarian pet.  At 200
nutrition a lichen corpse can be very handy and can even be used to
tame a new p/h/wh.  I wouldn't waste a scroll on taming the w.h. given
how many fruits and veggies are sitting around the dungeon.  

